# 
_pdbx_database_remark.id     999 
_pdbx_database_remark.text   
;SEQUENCE

NOT ALL THE CHAINS IN THE MODEL ARE HUMAN, ALTHOUGH 
THE PROTEINS USED TO DETERMINE THE 7.5 A STRUCTURE 
OF THE TFR-TF COMPLEX WERE ALL HUMAN. THE AUTHORS 
CREATED THE  MODEL BY FITTING X-RAY CRYSTAL 
STRUCTURES INTO THEIR 7.5 A EM DENSITY MAP. SINCE 
THERE IS NO STRUCTURE FOR THE HUMAN TRANSFERRIN 
C-LOBE, THE AUTHORS OPTED TO USE THE C-LOBE FROM 
RABBIT TF (1JNF). THE OTHER TWO CHAINS ARE HUMAN 
(1CX8 - HUMAN TFR AND 1A8E - HUMAN TF N-LOBE). THE 
CHAINS E AND F MATCH SWS P19134, A RABBIT SOURCE.

REGARDING THE CONFLICTS: BOTH SEQUENCE AND COORDINATES 
ARE FROM THE ORIGINAL PDB-FILES AND THE AUTHORS DID 
NOT MAKE ANY MODIFICATIONS TO IT.
;
